WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:13.070
63. Winter Blues. The days get shorter, the air gets colder, and we all get stuck inside

2
00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:20.590
a lot more. Who wouldn't find winter just a little bit depressing? Many of us may get

3
00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:26.550
a bit blue in the winter, living in the dark, unable to enjoy the weather very much. But

4
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:33.870
for some people, these blues can become something quite serious. Seasonal affective disorder

5
00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:40.350
appropriately shortened to SAD is the name for a mood disorder that causes normally mentally

6
00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:47.510
healthy people to become seriously depressed in the winter. People with SAD may start to

7
00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:53.990
have trouble waking up on winter mornings. Some of them may even feel sick in the morning.

8
00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:59.630
They may lose their energy, especially in the afternoon, and they may move slowly and

9
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:06.910
sluggishly. Unlike with other types of depression, people with SAD feel hungrier than usual and

10
00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:12.710
desire carbohydrates. One sign of SAD, in fact, is gaining significant weight in the

11
00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:20.550
winter. SAD sufferers may often become irritable and stop wanting to see friends and family.

12
00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:25.870
Doctors don't know exactly why people get SAD, but two things are probably important

13
00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:33.110
causes—sunlight and hormones in the body. Sunlight is important in several ways. It

14
00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:39.430
tells us when to sleep and when to wake up. This may explain the problems SAD sufferers

15
00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:46.590
have waking up. Sunlight can also affect how much serotonin our brains produce. Serotonin

16
00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:52.830
influences happiness. The lack of sunlight may also cause people to make more melanin,

17
00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:59.630
a hormone which makes us slow and sleepy. People fight SAD in different ways. Some

18
00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:05.470
take medication, others use exercise, bright light treatment, or a healthy diet to keep

19
00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:12.110
themselves balanced during the SAD season. If you feel winter blues coming on this year,

20
00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:17.830
take them seriously. Fight them with things that cheer you up and keep you excited about

21
00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.110
the coming spring.
